{#- _chat.html.j2 — the site assistant's launcher (owner decision 2026-10-16, CLAUDE.md 3.10), included once by
    base.html.j2 at the end of <body> on every page of every language (lang: ko, en and, when their pages exist, ja,
    zh-Hans, zh-Hant, de, fr, es, ru; any other falls back to English). It is only this button: assets/site.js loads
    assets/chat.js + assets/chat.css on its first press, or after load when this tab left the chat open on the
    previous page — nothing else of the chat is in the first paint (its rules are css/49-chat.css). Hidden without JS.
    Any other element with data-chat-open opens the chat too.
    data-chat: the city's words for chat.js in the page's language — the public address, the assistant's and the
    region's names, the example questions (pipeline/chat_index.py ui_config, from site.json chatbot); none of them is
    written in the scripts. The accessible name starts with the visible label (WCAG 2.5.3) and says what it is for.
    The look follows the first site (owner 2026-10-13 night and 2026-10-14): a round button with the mascot's face
    (_mascot.html.j2, mascot-icon-3d at 1× and 2×, width/height set) on every page from the first paint, the words
    'AI 챗봇' (each language's) always on a sea-blue tag across the bottom of the circle (css/49-chat.css). On the homes
    below 1024px it steps aside while their own question box is on screen (body.has-ask, site.js html.ask-out); there
    the launcher goes to that box (chat.js dock mode) instead of opening the panel. On the Korean pages from 1024px the
    floating quick menu sits above it (css/46-quick.css, css/49-chat.css): a white vertical pill with the few real
    actions — 검색, 지도, 행사 달력 (each only when its page is built; on a place page 길찾기, its own block instead of
    행사 달력), 맨 위로 (#main-content, the top of the page's content, without JS too) — 44px round targets with their names (aria-label + title, a tooltip on
    hover/focus); it comes after the footer in the reading order. Phones: only the launcher. -#}
{% import "_mascot.html.j2" as mm %}
{% set chat_cfg = chat_ui(site, lang) if site is defined and site else {} %}
{% set chat_region = chat_cfg.region if chat_cfg else '' %}
{% set chat_labels = {
  'ko': ('AI 챗봇', 'AI 챗봇 — ' ~ ((chat_region ~ ' ') if chat_region else '') ~ '여행 질문하기'),
  'en': ('AI chat', 'AI chat — ask a travel question'),
  'ja': ('AIチャット', 'AIチャット — 旅行について質問する'),
  'zh-Hans': ('AI助手', 'AI助手 — 提出旅行问题'),
  'zh-Hant': ('AI助手', 'AI助手 — 提出旅行問題'),
  'de': ('KI-Chat', 'KI-Chat — Fragen zur Reise'),
  'fr': ('Chat IA', 'Chat IA — une question sur le voyage'),
  'es': ('Chat IA', 'Chat IA — preguntar sobre el viaje'),
  'ru': ('ИИ-чат', 'ИИ-чат — вопрос о поездке'),
} %}
{% set cl = chat_labels.get(lang) or chat_labels['en'] %}
{% if lang == 'ko' and site is defined %}{% import "_ui.html.j2" as qui %}
{% set nav_hrefs = (nav or [])|map(attribute=1)|list if nav is defined else [] %}
{% set QM = [('search', '검색', '/search/') if has_search else none, ('map', '지도', '/map/') if '/map/' in nav_hrefs else none,
             ('route', '길찾기', ctxbtn[1]) if ctxbtn and ctxbtn[1] == '#h-dir' else (('calendar', '행사 달력', '/events/') if '/events/' in nav_hrefs else none),
             ('up', '맨 위로', '#main-content')] %}
<nav class="qm" aria-label="빠른 메뉴"><ul>{% for it in QM if it %}<li><a class="qm-i" href="{{ it[2] }}" aria-label="{{ it[1] }}" title="{{ it[1] }}" data-tip="{{ it[1] }}">{{ qui.icon(it[0]) }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></nav>
{% endif %}
<button type="button" class="chat-fab" data-chat-open data-chat="{{ chat_cfg|tojson_attr }}" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="{{ cl[1] }}"><span class="chat-fab-face">{{ mm.pic('mascot-icon-3d', 'icon', 52) }}</span><span class="chat-fab-l">{{ cl[0] }}</span></button>
